00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:43.087
that are...

00:02:43.087 --> 00:02:44.813
They haven't gotten vaccinated

00:02:44.813 --> 00:02:46.800
and they don't know if they are,

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.100
but just looking at the information

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.610
and all the conflicting
opinions is very intimidating,

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:53.690
overwhelming, anxiety-inducing

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:58.030
and you just wanna curl
up in a ball and avoid it.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:01.470
- We live in a very interesting time

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:06.470
where it is legitimately very
difficult to move forward

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.150
with decisions like this without at least

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:13.010
some sort of hesitancy because
of the way the information

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:14.860
and misinformation spreads, right?

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:16.670
- And because there's so much attachment

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.470
to what these decisions
mean about who you are,

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:23.040
who you're affiliated with,
what your core beliefs are.

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:24.370
- Everything has been politicized.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:26.320
It's very--
- Yeah.

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:28.190
- It's loaded.

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.880
All these decisions and
perspectives are so loaded.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:33.360
- Yeah, well, here's
what I'm gonna try to do.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.310
I'm gonna try to put this...

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:38.800
And again, I'm not a
scientist, I'm not a doctor.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:39.983
You already knew that.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.930
I'm a guy who eats weird
things on the internet

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:45.943
and has a podcast with his best friend.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.340
Hi Link.
- Hey!

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:50.510
- But I am a concerned citizen.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:53.550
And I've been thinking about this in a way

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:57.000
that I hope can cut through

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.003
a lot of the numbers and the
arguments and a lot of things

00:04:02.203 --> 00:04:04.480
that can get kind of
confusing and misleading

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:07.670
and just kinda talk to you as a friend.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.510
Now, first of all,

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.190
if you think that the
medical establishment

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.380
is an extension of the Deep State

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:16.040
and the vaccine campaign is a scheme

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:18.390
to inject microchips into
people, to control them,

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:21.010
this pitch is not for you, okay?

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.120
You can fast forward,

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.599
or you're probably not listening already,

00:04:24.599 --> 00:04:25.730
but if you are listening,

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:27.030
I do have something for you at the end,

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:28.460
so please stick around.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.310
- Ooh!

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:32.560
- This is my pitch for those
of you who are on the fence.

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.230
You have reservations about the vaccine.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.440
You've heard about the side effects.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:36.720
What about those blood clots?

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:38.450
Why aren't these vaccines
developed really quickly?

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:41.380
How do you know that
they're safe long-term

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.260
and by the way, COVID,
isn't that dangerous?

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.670
Why would I get a vaccine
with unknown side effects

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.410
when I'd probably be fine if I got COVID?

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:53.140
If you thought anything
like that, this is for you.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.820
Okay, so let's start with

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:56.480
the ultimate purpose of the vaccine.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:00.470
The vaccine is not primarily
about protecting you

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.260
individually from the virus.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:04.640
Vaccines are our best available tool

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:07.200
for eliminating disease
across a population.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.500
In this case, all of humanity.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.680
This is how we end a disease.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:15.160
So, framing the decision
around your own personal risk

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.982
is kind of missing the point.

00:05:16.982 --> 00:05:20.510
This isn't about you as
much as it's about us.

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:21.343
It's not a me thing.

00:05:21.343 --> 00:05:22.533
It's a we thing.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.280
Now, speaking of the we thing.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:29.250
If we don't reach herd immunity,

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:31.450
there's a real risk of
COVID continuing to evolve

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.250
and form variants and we're
gonna be dealing with this

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:34.720
for a very long time.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:36.380
The more people who get the vaccine,

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:37.760
the more likely we beat it.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:39.690
And even if we don't reach
herd immunity, which,

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:41.190
given the vaccine hesitancy

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.573
and the limited rollout around the world,

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:45.660
there's a very real possibility

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:48.200
we will not reach herd
immunity as we would like to,

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:53.200
but even so, more vaccines mean
less of a problem with COVID

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.150
for everybody down the line.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:58.190
So, it's not like a
lost cause by any means.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.380
Now you may have heard

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.760
that the vaccines don't stop
infection, or transmission,

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.500
but they only lessen the symptoms.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:08.487
And you might be asking, "Well,
why do I have to wear a mask

00:06:08.487 --> 00:06:10.341
"after I get vaccinated?"

00:06:10.341 --> 00:06:14.010
Well, scientists are actually
very hesitant to make claims

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:14.980
until they have good data.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:16.864
It's kinda their thing.

00:06:16.864 --> 00:06:20.650
But they're getting a
lot of data very quickly.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.940
And the latest data indicates
that these new vaccines,

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:26.400
not only prevent severe
COVID and hospitalization

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:30.230
almost completely, but
they also very likely

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:32.150
prevent infection as well as transmission.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:35.470
Therefore, the hesitancy
to move beyond masks

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:37.730
and social distancing has been

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:41.540
because we wanna make sure
that that is the case, okay?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.593
That's a big part for that.

00:06:42.593 --> 00:06:44.470
A big part of that.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:47.170
But what about the risks?

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.730
This seems to be the thing
that most people talk about.

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:50.400
What about the risks?

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:52.810
Specifically the thing
that I hear a lot is,

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:55.100
if the mortality rate of COVID is so low,

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.983
is it worth taking the risk
of getting the vaccine?

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:02.220
Well, the mortality rate
of COVID isn't that low.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:03.910
There are a lot of factors
and data's still coming in,

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.840
but COVID is likely, at least 10 times,

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.420
more deadly than the flu.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.520
But, I'll give it to you.

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:12.400
Even if you get it especially
if you're not in a risk group,

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.963
you very likely will not die from COVID.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:18.713
Now for me, a healthy dude,

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:22.070
not that young, 43,

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:25.790
but I'm not in a risk group,
I don't have risk factors,

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.500
but it's the long-term
complications from COVID

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.790
that are the most
concerning to me personally.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:33.210
Long-term symptoms
affect people of all ages

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.570
and have occurred in
people with mild, moderate

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.460
and severe COVID-19.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:39.340
These can include lung
damage, heart damage,

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:41.880
lasting fatigue, joint pain,
neurological disorders,

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:45.160
loss of taste and smell, sleep disorders.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:48.223
And these are showing up
in significant numbers.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:52.760
Okay, but, okay, I get that.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:55.586
But what about the risks of the vaccines?

00:07:55.586 --> 00:07:58.040
Well, let's start with the blood
clots from the J&amp;J vaccine.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.920
The Johnson and Johnson
vaccine 'cause that's what,

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.500
at least right now, as
we're recording this,

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.183
that's what everybody's talking about.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:07.570
Six people out of about 7
million who were vaccinated

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.490
developed blood clots.

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:11.160
And as of today, as of recording this,

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:13.210
one of those people has died.

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:14.270
That's horrible.

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:15.243
That's upsetting.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:18.780
But just to put that into perspective,

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:22.180
it's about one in a million
chance of getting a blood clot

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:25.860
and a one in 7 million chance of dying

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.140
from a blood clot from the J&amp;J vaccine.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:31.030
To put that into perspective,
you're much more likely

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.890
to die in a car accident on
the way to get the vaccine

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:36.109
than you are to get a blood
clot from the vaccine,

00:08:36.109 --> 00:08:38.223
much less die from the vaccine.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:43.490
But keep in mind they still
paused the J&amp;J vaccine

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:46.050
in many places because of this risk

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:48.930
because the scientists are
actually very concerned

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.460
with safety, so much so when there's this

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:57.390
statistical blip on the
radar they stop to evaluate.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.060
They're not trying to
take advantage of you.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.950
They're not trying to
use you as guinea pigs.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.640
They're actually showing that

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.970
safety is their number one priority.

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:07.640
Okay, but that's J&amp;J.

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:10.710
That's only a small
percentage of the vaccines.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.430
What about mRNA?

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:13.627
The Moderna, which is what I got

00:09:13.627 --> 00:09:15.280
and the Pfizer which is what you got?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:16.150
- Hm mm.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.800
- This stuff's unproven, right?

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:20.550
I mean, we are just a bunch of guinea pigs

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:21.893
being experimented on.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:25.143
Well, we have a lot of
good reasons to believe

00:09:25.143 --> 00:09:27.575
that mRNA vaccines are safe.

00:09:27.575 --> 00:09:30.910
Likely safer than traditional vaccines

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:32.943
for a number of reasons.

00:09:32.943 --> 00:09:33.776
So, they underwent

00:09:33.776 --> 00:09:35.810
some of the most rigorous
safety testing ever.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:39.920
Fast, quick, yes, but
rigorous nonetheless.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:40.753
- Hm mm.

00:09:40.753 --> 00:09:43.000
- But what about the long-term risks?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.910
Well, these vaccines are
actually not that new.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:48.850
Trials were conducted
for mRMA vaccines in 2009

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:51.820
for prostate cancer, 2013 for rabies

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.990
and mRMA vaccines were
already in clinical trials

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.520
for HIV, cancer and Zika-patients

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.670
before the development
of the COVID vaccines

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:02.460
and nothing found in those
trials led to hesitancy

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:04.970
to move forward with COVID-19 vaccines.

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:06.490
This isn't something that was just pulled

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:09.800
out of the back pocket
of scientists and doctors

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:13.320
in response to this pandemic.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:15.070
It was something they had been working on

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:16.223
for quite some time.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:20.750
And the mechanism of mRNA vaccines

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.460
is a new approach to vaccines,

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:24.880
but it's actually really straightforward

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:28.583
and there are lots of
advantages, including safety.

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:32.280
Now, there's a lot of
misinformation about this,

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:34.790
but messenger-RNA
doesn't get anywhere near

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.800
the nucleus of the cell
that contains human DNA.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.440
And it disintegrates
quickly after the message

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.710
that it is communicating, is read.

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:46.653
It does not alter your DNA
because it cannot alter your DNA.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.710
Now you may have read on the
internet about scary things

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.740
like antibody dependent enhancement,

00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:55.590
the idea that getting these
vaccines is gonna cause you

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:59.370
to actually have a higher
chance of dying down the line

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.280
from getting COVID-19,
especially a variant,

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.310
or that there are
ingredients in the vaccine

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.563
that might cause cancer.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.170
All of this was taken into account

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:09.810
when developing the vaccine

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.820
and there is no reason to believe

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.230
that these are risks from the vaccines.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.940
Just plain and simple.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:17.010
There's a lot of good
literature on all of this

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.120
and how these things were studied in depth

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.280
throughout the development,

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.950
including the antibody
dependent enhancement,

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:24.800
which is something I see a
lot of people talk about.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:27.360
Now, does that mean that
nobody will have adverse,

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:30.230
short-term, or long-term
complications from the vaccine?

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:31.083
Of course not.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:36.050
People are going to have adverse
reactions to this vaccine.

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:38.240
And with so many people being vaccinated,

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:42.920
we're going to see significant,
statistically small,

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.710
but significant because anything
that happens to a person

